  "question": {
    "text": "The weight of a body on the earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then weight of the body when taken to a depth half of the radius of the earth will be:",
